            "detailed_description": "The all-new Silent Service II A State Of The Art Simulation Of Submarines In World War II.<br><br>The original Silent Service was released in 1985. It won &quot; Simulation of the Year&quot; honours in six nations and was voted &quot;Best Adventure Game for the Home Computer&quot; by the Academy of Adventure Gaming Arts and Design in 1986.<br><br>Now Silent Service II updates the classic with latest advances in sound, graphics and game design, including new targets and scenarios.<br><br><br><strong>Game Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Outstanding graphics and digitized photographs depict enemy ships with uncanny realism.<br></li><li>The new campaign option tracks your career with promotions and commendations.<br></li><li>State-of-the-art sounds and original music recreate an atmosphere beneath the waves so true to life, you'll be coming up for air!</li></ul>",
